{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then ndim(v_1) - 1 else -1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (dtype must not be a string token; prevents uninterpretable dtype)
{v_2 : dtype ⊎ str} |= v_2 ≠ "none" ∧ v_2 ≠ "sum" ∧ v_2 ≠ "max"
